<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Africa, Mideast.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Africa, Mideast.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it accepted a bid from Agri-Best Dairy Products Inc to sell 119 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to Africa and the Middle East.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was set at $790 per tonne and delivery was set for Jan. 24 - March 31.</p>
<p>The DEIP balance for Africa and the Middle East is 16,215 tonnes.</p>
</text>
